      CS grad from
      <a class="u" href="https://www.nottingham.ac.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Nottingham<span class="tip box" style="--accent:var(--agent)"><b>BSc Computer Science</b>Plus a research internship on vector-database search.</span></a>.
      Aviation geek.
    </p>
    <div class="ctas"><a class="btn" href="#projects">See projects ↓</a></div>
    <ul class="socials">
      <li><a href="https://github.com/hootyhoot" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub ↗</a></li>
